This project vendors a modified copy of the TEF parser from TScript34.

Upstream: https://github.com/TOGoS/TScript34
Source tree: subtrees/p0014/master and subtrees/p0010/master
Files derived from upstream:

  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/tef/TEFParser.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/tef/LLChunks.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/tef/LLChunkMerger.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/tef/util/ArrayUtil.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/tef/util/DucerUtil.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/ducer/Function.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/ducer/DucerChunk.java
  src/main/java/net/nuke24/togetl/ducer/DucerState2.java

The files have been modified for this project: package names were changed,
source spans, comments, and directives were added, and recovery behavior was
extended. The upstream license follows.

